Licensing of this artifact
==========================

Every file states its copyright holders and licence in an SPDX header, e.g.

    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Stef Halmans, Niklas Höher
    SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-RUB-SecEng

The full licence texts are in the LICENSES/ directory:

    LICENSES/LicenseRef-RUB-SecEng.txt   files written by Stef Halmans and
                                         Niklas Höher (Chair for Security
                                         Engineering, Ruhr-Universitaet Bochum)
    LICENSES/MIT.txt                     third-party files under the MIT licence
                                         (see their headers for the copyright
                                         holders)
